ana peringkat.","Freefall":"Jatuh Bebas","Drop through 4+ rings in one fall.":"Jatuhkan melalui 4+ cincin dalam satu musim gugur.","Creature of Habit":"Makhluk Tabiat","Complete the Daily Drop 3 days in a row.":"Selesaikan Daily Drop 3 hari berturut-turut.","Crown of the Spiral":"Mahkota Lingkaran","Clear Journey stage 40.":"Selesaikan peringkat 40 Journey.","Thousand Layers":"Seribu Lapisan","Descend 1000 layers total.":"Turun 1000 lapisan secara keseluruhan.","Drop":"Jatuhkan","Layer passed ×{n}":"Lapisan dilalui ×{n}","Combo ×{n}":"Kombo ×{n}","Precision landing":"Pendaratan ketepatan","Danger sector smashed":"Sektor bahaya dihancurkan","Danger sector — run over":"Sektor bahaya — larian selesai","Undone":"Dibatalkan","Stage complete":"Peringkat lengkap","Achievement unlocked":"Pencapaian dibuka","Ember Dusk":"Senja Arang","Deep Tide":"Pasang Dalam","Neon Orchard":"Dusun Neon","Paper Dawn":"Fajar Kertas","Monochrome Signal":"Isyarat Monokrom","First Drop":"Titisan Pertama","Steady Hand":"Tangan Stabil","Around the Rim":"Mengelilingi Bibir","Long Way Down":"Jauh Menurun","Rhythm":"Irama","High Tower":"Menara Tinggi","Quickstep":"Langkah Pantas","Summit Drill":"Latih Tubi Sidang Kemuncak","Narrow Door":"Pintu Sempit","Thread It":"Jalin Tali","Twin Turns":"Pusingan Berkembar","Patient Fall":"Pesakit Jatuh","Combo Shaft":"Lubang Kombo","Deep Combo":"Kombo Dalam","Needle":"Jarum","Mastery Ring":"Cincin Penguasaan","First Hazard":"Bahaya Pertama","Red Arc":"Arka Merah","Watch the Paint":"Tonton Cat","Hazard Pair":"Pasangan Bahaya","Threaded Needle":"Jarum Berulir","Split Decision":"Keputusan Terpisah","Hazard Rows":"Barisan Bahaya","Mastery Fire":"Kebakaran Penguasaan","Drift Lesson":"Pelajaran Drift","Slow Sway":"Bergoyang Perlahan","Counterspin":"Pusaran Balas","Drift Shaft":"Aci Hanyut","Moving Target":"Sasaran Bergerak","Double Drift":"Drift Berganda","Hazard Drift":"Hanyutan Bahaya","Mastery Tide":"Pasang Penguasaan","Tight Squeeze":"Keadaan Sempit","Gauntlet":"Sarung Tangan","Thin Ice":"Ais Nipis","Combo Weave":"Anyaman Kombo","Pressure Drop":"Penurunan Tekanan","Long Fall":"Musim Gugur Panjang","Last Door":"Pintu Terakhir","Mastery Crown":"Mahkota Penguasaan","Calm":"Tenang","Standard":"Standard","Expert":"Pakar","Minimal Touch":"Sentuhan Minimum","Reach the base with a tight rotation budget.":"Capai pangkalan dengan bajet putaran yang ketat.","Speedrun Spiral":"Lingkaran Speedrun","Beat the clock to the base.":"Kalahkan jam ke asas.","Needlework":"Kerja Jarum","Very narrow gaps. Precision is everything.":"Jurang yang sangat sempit. Ketepatan adalah segala-galanya.","Drift Storm":"Ribut Hanyut","Every layer drifts. Read the motion.":"Setiap lapisan hanyut. Baca usul.","The Long Drop":"Kejatuhan Panjang","Forty layers. Endurance and nerve.":"Empat puluh lapisan. Ketahanan dan saraf.","Breaker":"Pemecah","Danger everywhere — chain drops to smash through.":"Bahaya di mana-mana — gugurkan rantaian untuk menembusi.","Rotate the Tower":"Putar Menara","The tower turns; the ball does not. Rotate left and right with ←/→, A/D, the on-screen arrows, or by dragging.":"Menara berpusing; bola tidak. Putar ke kiri dan kanan dengan ←/→, A/D, anak panah pada skrin atau dengan menyeret.","Find the Gap":"Cari Jurang","Line the glowing gap up with the ball and it drops through. Pass every layer to reach the base.":"Gariskan celah bercahaya dengan bola dan ia jatuh. Lulus setiap lapisan untuk mencapai pangkalan.","Danger Sectors":"Sektor Bahaya","Striped sectors are dangerous. Never land on one — rotate past them before you drop.":"Sektor berjalur berbahaya. Jangan sekali-kali mendarat di atas satu — putar melepasinya sebelum anda jatuh.","Combos":"Kombo","Drop through several layers without landing for bonus points. Aligned gaps make a shaft — release and fall!":"Jatuhkan melalui beberapa lapisan tanpa mendarat untuk mata bonus. Jurang sejajar membuat aci — lepas dan jatuh!","Smash Through":"Hancurkan","Pass 3 layers in one drop and the ball c